STAFF REPORT - SUMMATION

Lot 14, Block 5, Replat Homestead Addition, First Filing
Zoning Map Amendment Process

CASE NUMBER:
UDC-18-00070

SUBDIVISION CODE: HAN 01
PREPARED BY:
Eric Hammer / Seth Lloyd

MEETING DATES:
April 2, 2018 – Planning Commission

Public Meeting
April 9, 2018 – City Council

1st Reading
April 17, 2018 – Public Services Committee

1st Reading
April 23, 2018 – City Council

2nd Reading
May 8, 2018 – Public Services Committee

2nd Reading
May 14, 2018 – City Council

3rd Reading

REQUIRED DOCUMENTS SUBMISSION: The following required documents have been submitted and
reviewed by staff.

•
Master Application; Zone Change Map; List of Neighbors to be Notified; Draft Neighbor
Notification Letter; - Submitted 2/23/2018 as the original project submission.

PLANNING COMMISSION RECOMMENDATION:  At their regular meeting on April 2, 2018, the City
of Cheyenne Planning Commission voted 3-1 to recommend approval of the zone change request from
County MR Medium-density Residential to NR-2 Neighborhood Residential – Medium Density.

STAFF RECOMMENDATION:  Staff recommends approval of the zone change request from County MR
Medium-density Residential to NR-2 Neighborhood Residential – Medium Density with no recommended
staff conditions.
```

