### Page 4 of 13

```text
Lot 14, Block 5, Replat Homestead Addition, First Filing Zone Change
UDC-18-00070

P a g e | 3

EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:
This zone change application proposes changing the zoning classification of the subject property from
County MR Medium Density Residential to City NR-2 Neighborhood Development – Medium Density for
residential development purposes. The land is currently not within City limits, but the applicant has
submitted a petition to annex this land and will likely propose a replat of the land in the near future. As
the land does not currently have a City zoning designation, it must be rezoned in order to be developed.

The land proposed to be rezoned to NR-2 is intended to be developed with small detached dwellings
(single family homes). The proposal is generally congruent with the policies of PlanCheyenne and the
future land use designation of the land.

Due to meeting the review criteria of Section 2.2.1.d of the Cheyenne Unified Development
Code, staff recommends approval of this zone change.
```

